{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_02_title", "source_sha256": "dafdde2236957c744fd4aac28546beea956681ea36ed33503490252ae1af6ce3", "ja": "死の行進！　デストル怪獣軍団現る", "zh": "死亡行军！毁灭怪兽军团现身", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "e5a3809aa0b7af91758ee0189450053712dd2b6ca85a8e43887b62fdf045da4c", "ja": "ヒーローの噂を聞き、デストルドーの幹部\nヒビキとエレナが怪獣軍団と共に強襲する。\nその怪獣軍団をあずさの一撃で一掃された\nヒビキは、アマゾンから巨大怪獣を呼び出そ\nうとするも失敗し、エレナと共に撤退する！", "zh": "听闻英雄的传闻后，Destrudo的干部\n响与艾蕾娜和怪兽军团一同发动突袭。\n怪兽军团被梓一击全部消灭，\n响本想从亚马逊召唤出巨型怪兽，却以失败告终，只得和艾蕾娜一同撤退！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_02_1000_026yur", "source_sha256": "0fc38fad1fee263f4c14422f47d62d206fe1e97f8e684dc72b6f3341763d8d4a", "ja": "暴力の化身、デストルドー。彼らは強大な力を持つ、\n少数の幹部たちによって統制されていた。", "zh": "暴力的化身——毁灭军团。他们由掌握强大力量的\n少数干部所统率。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_02_1001_026yur", "source_sha256": "603f6ccb211c4911eb5ddf66e3b60cec88b032eb6ca66bfcef51dd5e53d8c8e7", "ja": "そしてその支配は、東京の遥か彼方、\n南米アマゾンのジャングルの奥地にも及んでいた！", "zh": "而那份统治甚至延伸到了远在东京彼方、南美亚马孙丛林深处！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_02_1002_018ele", "source_sha256": "0106467a57d2e17b7b3d9d8b63e78926154730fa6e65a0ae2c0151302d6f9fdf", "ja": "マイティセーラー？　ワタシたちデストルドーに\n歯向かう、そんな生意気なヤツが現れたノ？", "zh": "Mighty Sailor？居然出现了胆敢反抗我们Destuldo的嚣张家伙吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_02_1003_013hib", "source_sha256": "5b090a3b1ea23f49bfacd414bccb7a14fbb788702973c578df3f84366d2986db", "ja": "そうらしい。だからカンペキな自分が思い知らせてやる\nつもりさー。このアマゾンのデストル怪獣軍団でね！", "zh": "好像是这样。所以，完美的我就要让他们好好见识一下——靠这支亚马逊德斯特尔怪兽军团！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_02_1004_kaijyuugunndan", "source_sha256": "a23ca075279944101ab007accba754656fc6d2e77c7647e1eba3820fe5549846", "ja": "アンギャー！　アンギャー！　ウッキッキー！！", "zh": "啊嘎——！啊嘎——！呜叽叽——！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_02_1005_026yur", "source_sha256": "8804a23b73eaff4774558907afb44052264b7059de317688f500d8df60a104c4", "ja": "ヒビキ、そしてエレナ。ダンスのごとき、とめどない\n暴力が恐れられる、デストルドー幹部である。", "zh": "响，以及艾蕾娜。她们是德斯特鲁多的干部，因舞蹈般无休无止的暴力而令人畏惧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_02_1006_018ele", "source_sha256": "bf6ec9cad00eb9becce9f3da0ce02c11b38271c0b129020ca343ea846e889ee2", "ja": "面白そう。じゃあワタシも一緒に行くヨ！\nデストルワームホールで、地球の反対側にレッツゴー！", "zh": "听起来好有意思。那我也一起去！\n通过德斯特尔虫洞，前往地球的另一边吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_02_1007_026yur", "source_sha256": "80fb7f7dabae2d52cef02221eed3624fd24cd95c89bc357901f6238eae04e07f", "ja": "かくして、東京は突如として現れたアマゾンの怪獣軍団\nの襲撃を受け、未曽有の危機を迎えることとなった！", "zh": "就这样，东京遭到了突然出现的亚马逊怪兽军团袭击，迎来了前所未有的危机！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_02_1008_kaijyuugunndan", "source_sha256": "f2811b9bafe7015405155b40248af4e607e47655daf3eb61e08c60658a1bd5e7", "ja": "アンギャアアアアァァァァッ！！", "zh": "啊呀啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_02_1009_siminntati", "source_sha256": "5381dfd3c07cec0b541bf4963cc5efb4e676ee521450c646a3701b28dd34de5b", "ja": "うわあああ！！　怪獣だーーーっ！！！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊！！　是怪兽啊——！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_02_1010_013hib", "source_sha256": "dd6f9938d57c14f934945adac246c8fd9f0d06da1df96a9e6b253da8d8369acc", "ja": "あーっははは！　逃げるがいい、無力な弱者ども！\nもっとも、逃げる先などどこにもないがな！", "zh": "啊——哈哈哈！逃吧，毫无力量的弱者们！\n不过，你们根本无处可逃！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_02_1011_018ele", "source_sha256": "dbb994b1c6f06450964fdd1966db2b5911ce62f4b35d14e00b1af8f9dbcf5b96", "ja": "死ぬまでみんなで踊ってネ！\nエレナのデスサンバタイムの始まりだヨー！", "zh": "大家一起跳到死吧！\n艾蕾娜的死亡桑巴时间开始啦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_02_1012_kaijyuugunndan", "source_sha256": "f2811b9bafe7015405155b40248af4e607e47655daf3eb61e08c60658a1bd5e7", "ja": "アンギャアアアアァァァァッ！！", "zh": "啊呀啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_02_1013_siminntati", "source_sha256": "a89e2b1c898f1bd4c3d18995789c896bc79b54105ac0907ae7753de72cb97af4", "ja": "た、助けて！　助けてくれーーーーっ！！", "zh": "救、救命！救救我————！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_02_1014_010azu", "source_sha256": "3315876d0ceb7a36dd543893a81f3ad1c96945d8611e10950c288f9fa7ff67d5", "ja": "そこまでよ！\nマイティスプラーッシュ！！", "zh": "到此为止！\n强力水花——！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_02_1015_se", "source_sha256": "76d5a75da7b8990f5c797ebe3188d7a2786a7f9aa3c47a3238f87bf974ea0d33", "ja": "シュッパーーーーン！！", "zh": "咻——砰！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_02_1016_kaijyuugunndan", "source_sha256": "ee9125dcadfd7addc142397dd03cfc071b3a19f262db33932d0ed7e4d917c068", "ja": "ファッ！？　グアアアアァァァァァァ……！！！！", "zh": "啥！？　咕啊啊啊啊啊啊……！！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_02_1017_013hib", "source_sha256": "c6c16546bd1579de8b773391c74f7b41780612b72e890fe53df9497b6bbcebfa", "ja": "ああっ、怪獣軍団が飛ばされたっ！？\n待て、待ってよデスワニラー、デスピラニアーン！！", "zh": "啊啊，怪兽军团被吹飞了！？\n等等，等等啊，死神鳄鱼侠、死神食人鱼侠！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_02_1018_018ele", "source_sha256": "0127869da396bb0c50d657a751e3390ba16c993d6fa4dc94b4d324d15d9e9b97", "ja": "ヒビキの怪獣軍団を一蹴するとは……。\nさては、貴様がマイティセーラーだネ！？", "zh": "竟然能轻松击败响的怪兽军团……看来，你就是Mighty Sailor吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_02_1019_010azu", "source_sha256": "8531cc29488de2978d614e19a171ae5463003b15d611e72c8a1a3ac952a108e3", "ja": "そう、私はマイティセーラー。\n貴方達デストルドーから世界を護る者！", "zh": "没错，我就是Mighty Sailor。\n守护世界免受你们Destiny之手的战士！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_02_1020_026yur", "source_sha256": "3124eb2f9e5bba868e371a2ac4668632806c64ffa668750bd3ac5d63d51c5e41", "ja": "だが、あずさは理解していた。目の前にいる二人の敵は\n今までの相手と格が違うことに……！", "zh": "然而，梓明白，眼前的两个敌人和至今为止遇到的对手完全不是一个级别……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_02_1021_010azu", "source_sha256": "d19fa2bd24ca044afb76789d15e0658c636caa4250753dcb9246b78b0c2c61d1", "ja": "（感じる……この暗黒パワーの波動、尋常じゃないわ。\nこれが幹部クラスのデストルドーの力……！）", "zh": "（感觉到了……这股黑暗力量的波动，非同寻常。这就是干部级别的德斯特鲁多之力吗……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_02_1022_018ele", "source_sha256": "9eef3acea93cb32bcacf7ade835cb39a6a44a2bf0151a8ff50360c85879d3961", "ja": "覚悟するのはそっちだヨ、マイティセーラー！\nブラジリアンデストルドーの力、思い知らせてアゲル！", "zh": "该做好觉悟的是你才对，强力水手！让你见识一下巴西暗黑战士的力量吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_02_1023_013hib", "source_sha256": "ebaa7d579584027e8d49c271aeee86f7592003d57fb7d6d91d6be58c9747d5dc", "ja": "遊びはこれまでだ！　アマゾンより出でよ！\n巨大怪獣デストラオーーーン！", "zh": "玩闹到此为止！自亚马逊现身吧！巨大怪兽德斯特拉奥——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_02_1024_se", "source_sha256": "cb07b4bfcade0aab98c91644b7ecf01d4ee476969948fdd9fe51f2a52a2e112d", "ja": "ゴゴゴゴゴゴゴ……ッ！！！", "zh": "轰隆隆隆隆隆……！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_02_1025_010azu", "source_sha256": "7c6d4559fcecc11c4a28f63a886a0c4067412256b7451c093dc8d2fd3e847b29", "ja": "はっ！？　なに、この強大な気配は……！？", "zh": "啊！？这股强大的气息是怎么回事……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_02_1026_026yur", "source_sha256": "de19a62ed283cc037193e5bba7d76e74c7822fce2e93749b8e78ff1c94706b5e", "ja": "巨大怪獣デストラオン。それは後にヒビキが生み出した\n暗黒怪獣のモデルとなる、天然デストル怪獣である！", "zh": "巨大怪兽德斯特拉翁。那是后来响制造出的\n暗黑怪兽的原型，天然的德斯特鲁怪兽！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_02_1027_desutoraon", "source_sha256": "f3f68c1b076c9fb730c861271bbbbe06f91b6b8b026aba2bb7c3b398f327b620", "ja": "ガオオオオオオン！！\n（破壊し尽くすオン！）", "zh": "嘎哦哦哦哦哦——！！\n（要把一切破坏殆尽！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_02_1028_013hib", "source_sha256": "4d7f54e0c98926aa6d34c5416a91cc3e3ae7002b488d6b5f26d03b8960c1f68c", "ja": "さあ、デストラオンよ！\nワームホールを通って現れるのだ！！", "zh": "来吧，德斯特拉翁！\n穿过虫洞现身吧！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_02_1029_013hib", "source_sha256": "76fb709901706d0971233a40ac857ee4b40f9a19efe691d7b834d96843c96164", "ja": "アーッハッッハッハッハ！", "zh": "啊哈哈哈哈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_02_1030_018ele", "source_sha256": "76fb709901706d0971233a40ac857ee4b40f9a19efe691d7b834d96843c96164", "ja": "アーッハッッハッハッハ！", "zh": "啊哈哈哈哈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_02_1033_018ele", "source_sha256": "fb447828c8a01ad5646e4731444ae01a2a6083233d9574f9412f2c12faa5e473", "ja": "来ないヨ？", "zh": "没来吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_02_1034_013hib", "source_sha256": "269a467bee14304566a14d1bbdef0b769614608c3544b1b2f5ca69cb3843cf24", "ja": "あれ？　おかしいな……。\nちょっと！　デストラオーン！　どうしたんだー！？", "zh": "咦？奇怪了……  \n喂！德斯特拉翁！你怎么了——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_02_1035_desutoraon", "source_sha256": "dcba7d4196f03b3e9cac9e7b23b89033799317506f326a8e2e4230991f0c176e", "ja": "ガ、ガオンガオオオオオン！\n（ワ、ワームホールが小さくて入れないオン！）", "zh": "嘎、嘎嗷嗷嗷嗷嗷——！\n（虫、虫洞太小了，进不去嗷！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_02_1036_013hib", "source_sha256": "2db294e74d4de28738e8f5749377e787d684e431414003956e50683085c810c2", "ja": "ええっ！？　だから食べ過ぎるなっていったのに～！！\nでも詰まったら大変だし……。仕方ない、また今度！", "zh": "诶！？所以才说不要吃太多了嘛～！！\n\n不过要是堵住了就麻烦了……没办法，下次再来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_02_1037_desutoraon", "source_sha256": "80b9758e4222bed64816aa9a49f0233c5f47bed12b2b4f8c3e9a3fd984b098a3", "ja": "ガオン……。\n（面目ありません……）", "zh": "咣……。\n（实在没脸见人……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_02_1038_018ele", "source_sha256": "3dffc1eb3c7854613f0f1b629bb5d6c331c54d851b1da08b2a8ecd4d539a898b", "ja": "ウーン、ちょっと予定が狂っちゃったネ？\n出直そっか？", "zh": "嗯——计划稍微被打乱了呢？\n要不要重新来过？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_02_1039_013hib", "source_sha256": "eedb87e75c3a8ad3a361c65679e85f5de495381a92990f4d1f76570f781f66e3", "ja": "そ、そうだな……。おいっ、マイティセーラー。\n興が削がれたから、今日は特別に引いてやろう。", "zh": "是、是啊……喂，Mighty Sailor。既然兴致被破坏了，今天就特别放你一马吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_02_1040_013hib", "source_sha256": "7a69bea5001de5f4e7fa001bc8a5eab3dbd0525a6d762d8466c32a5bbc9ab220", "ja": "だが、怪獣軍団の借りは必ず返すッ！\n我がリベリオンの名に懸けてな！", "zh": "但怪兽军团的这笔账，我一定会讨回来！以我反抗军之名发誓！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_02_1041_010azu", "source_sha256": "ab074e3d85e7f7e5577cb2ecbc4ecfbef8f54d527dbab01f4e8b692caab86ff9", "ja": "あっ、待ちなさい、デストルドー！\n待……。くっ。", "zh": "啊，等等，死灭！\n等……唔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_02_1042_010azu", "source_sha256": "64fbb30865af6147f7572c941ef372f2c3cee4cf496c78712196cad3c75234be", "ja": "あれがデストルドー幹部達なのね……。\nまだ波動を感じるわ……。", "zh": "那些就是迪斯特鲁多的干部们吧……\n我还能感受到波动……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_02_1043_026yur", "source_sha256": "b37067c8e35f2400a90a98d054188248ec3dc9ada2cbd77d4e90080bcc0fdbd0", "ja": "マイティセーラーあずさの活躍により、\n街は平穏を取り戻した。", "zh": "多亏了无敌水手阿梓的活跃，城市恢复了平静。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_02_1044_026yur", "source_sha256": "20e472ced5bef983e6bfe4031aea3ba42a333cc9f2a8bedb69007f442224982e", "ja": "しかし、あずさは戦慄するのだった。\nデストルドー達の真の実力と、その強大さに。", "zh": "然而，梓却因恐惧而战栗。\n因为Destiny们真正的实力，以及那强大的力量。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_02_1045_026yur", "source_sha256": "7b582609b1699c7339fc114cd3cb109e1dbe7f96e97607218b18332b3449c1a0", "ja": "次回『新たな光！　復讐の刃は愛とともに』！\n……え、なんかすごい！　期待しちゃいますよ！？", "zh": "下回《新的光芒！与爱同行的复仇之刃》！\n……诶，感觉好厉害！让人不禁期待起来了！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
